<Portfolio title="Privacy" description="How the Under the Haik portfolio handles browsing and links to external enquiry services.">
<article class="service-document wrap"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>This portfolio has no connected analytics, advertising trackers, newsletter subscription or contact form.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical information such as your IP address when serving pages. Its own privacy practices apply.</p><h2>External websites and enquiries</h2><p>Portfolio demos and Instagram links lead to other services. Their privacy practices apply when you visit them. If you enquire through Instagram, share only the information needed to discuss your project.</p><h2>Portfolio previews</h2><p>Some demonstration websites store local preferences or allow you to prepare a message draft. Concept demos do not send bookings or payments; follow the explanation on each demo.</p></article>
</Portfolio>
